    "md5": "159a58cdf9a13690bdcd9e50a8514a0e",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1824,
    "chunk_text": "By-law on Dangerous, Unpleasant, Dangerous and Unpleasant business operated within the area of\n\nauthority of Rambukkana Pradeshiya Sabha\n\n1. This By-Law is enacted to regulate, administrate and control businesses which are in the area of the Rambukkana Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\n3.(1) No person shall maintain a business premises in the area of the Rambukkana Pradeshiya Sabha, (hereinafter referred to as the premises) unless there is a valid license issued by the Chairman.\n\n3.(2) A person who wishes to obtain a license pursuant to section 3 (1) above shall apply by an application prepared in accordance with the fourth schedule of this by-law.\n\n3.(3) The fee for a license under this by-law shall be lawful by the Sabha, subject to the provisions of the Basic Law, and shall be determined by a resolution of the Sabha.\n\n04.(1) Any person who wishes to commence and maintain a premises which is subject to a permit under section 3(1) above shall have his prior approval of the Chairman under this by-law and otherwise there is no entitlement to apply for a license under section 3(2) of the Act.\n\n4.(2) A request for prior approval under this section shall be approved by the Chairman on the recommendation of the Public Health Inspector and the Medical Officer of Health.\n\n4.(3) The inspection fee to be charged under the approval of this section may be determined by the Sabha from time to time by the passed resolution.\n\n5. Every person applying for a license under section 3(2) of this by-law must meet the following conditions:\n\n5.(1) Approval under section 4(1) of the by-law when the business is a start-up business.\n\n5.(2) If zoning has been done or industrial zones have been designated, the zoning shall comply with the construction of buildings for Dangerous, Unpleasant, Dangerous and Unpleasant business locations."
  },
