    "chunk_text": "20. Any license holder of a premises or any other authority authorized by the Public Health Inspector or the Public Health Inspector, or any authorized person by the Chairman, shall be legally entitled to receive any food, other substance or liquid in any premises for the purpose of payment. Refuse or obstruct such purchases in any means.\n\n22. It is an offense to maintain premises without a license to be obtained under this By-Law or to violate any of the provisions of the By-Law, and after being convicted by a court of competent jurisdiction for such offense, 122 of the Pradeshiya Sabha Act No. 15 of 1987 (2) Subject to a fine referred to in subsection (2). When a person who has been convicted of an offense continues to violate or interrupt the offense by a court of competent jurisdiction over such offense, a written notice shall be delivered by the Chairman, the Medical Officer of Health or the Public Health Inspector with a view to the violation. Each subsequent day the violation continues for this purpose an additional fine of the said section shall also be liable.\n\n25A IV(\u0d85) \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.12.05 PART IV(A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.12.2019\n\n23. Unless otherwise required in this By-Law,\n\n\"Chairman\" means the person holding the office of Chairman of this Pradeshiya Sabha or performing the functions of that office.\n\n\"Pradeshiya Sabha\" means Rambukkana Pradeshiya Sabha\n\n\"Medical Officer of Health\" means the person holding the office of any Medical Officer of Health in the area of the Pradeshiya Sabha area.\n\n\"Public Health Inspector\" means the person holding the office of any Public Health Inspector in the area of the Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\n\"Authorized officer\" means any officer authorized by the Chairman at the moment,\n\n\"Licensee\" means an organization, person or person licensed under this By-Law;"
