    "chunk_text": "III. Phone number: Mobile:- Land phone :-\n\nI certify that the above information is true and correct.\n\nI request you to issue a Trade License for the year of \u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026. I agree with the existing rules on this.\n\n44 A IV(\u0d85) \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.12.05 PART IV(A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.12.2019\n\nFor office use\n\nRevenue Inspector,\n\nKindly request to provide you with your observations and recommendations for the issuance of a trade license in respect of the application mentioned in the back page.\n\n................... Date :- Secretary. -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSecretary,\n\nRecommended/not recommended issuing license\n\n......................... Date :- Revenue Inspector. -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nMedical Officer of Health\n\nPlease kindly request that your observations and recommendations for the issuance of a commercial license be issued promptly.\n\n...................... Date: - Secretary. -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nMedical Officer of Health\n\nComply with by-laws and other rules and regulations I will report for issuing license.\n\n........................ Date: - Public Health Inspector. ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------