    "chunk_size_bytes": 1956,
    "chunk_text": "I recommend the issuance of a permit for the relevant place as per above application. (If not recommended, state the reason.)\n\n...................... Date: - Medical Officer of Health\n\nSECOND SCHEDULE\n\nPhotograph\n\nMedical Certificate issued to the worker in tea, coffee and short eat shops\n\n....................... ............................ Date Medical Officer of Health (Official Seal) 12-687/7\n\n____________________________________\n\nRAMBUKKANA PRADESHIYA SABHA\n\nBy- Law regarding Distribution of Free Food\n\nThis is to notify that I, Dhamma Dissanayake, Governor of the Sabaragamuwa Province has approved the By-law regarding Prevention of Public Disturbances in the Distribution of Free Food within authoritative area of Rambukkana Pradeshiya Sabha, prepared by the Rambukkana Pradeshiya Sabha by virtue of powers vested in it under Section 122 read with Section 126 of Pradeshiya Sabha Act No. 15 of 1987 and passed at its General meeting held on 25.06.2019, by\n\n54 A IV(\u0d85) \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.12.05 PART IV(A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.12.2019\n\nvirtue of powers vested under Section 123(1) of Pradeshiya Sabha Act, read with Section 2 of Provincial Council (Consequential Provisions) Act No. 12 of 1989, and it will be effective within authoritative area of Rambukkana Pradeshiya Sabha from the date this notification is published in the Gazette. DHAMMA DISSANAYAKE, Governor, Sabaragamuwa Province. At the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council, On this 30th day of October, 2019.\n\nBy-Law on the Prevention of Public Disturbances in the Distribution of Free Food within Rambukkana\n\nPradeshiya Sabha Authoritative Area\n\n1. This by-law is enacted to protect the health of the public and the associated public health in the authoritative area of the Rambukkana Pradeshiya Sabha."
  },
