at may be a threat or future threat to the food security.\n\n....................... ............................ Date Medical Officer of Health. (Official Seal) 12-687/12\n\n____________________________________\n\nRAMBUKKANA PRADESHIYA SABHA\n\nBy- Law regarding Maintenance of Lodges and Guest Houses"
