    "chunk_text": "\"Food\" shall mean any goods imported, manufactured, sold or represented for the use of human food or beverages, and any goods or materials commonly taken or used in the composition or preparation of food,\n\n\"Reasonable Time\" shall mean a time that engaged in the licensed function or any related Activity.\n\nshall prevail.\n\nFirst Schedule\n\nThe following industries or businesses are hereby declared as unpleasant enterprises or industries for the purpose of Section 147 of the Pradeshiya Sabha Act,, No.15 of 1987.\n\n1. Cleaning or storing graphite.\n\n2. To manufacture or sell fertilizer or chemical fertilizer.\n\n3. Leather tanning.\n\n4. To manufacture rubber or to keep rubber bread.\n\n5. Rubber Products\n\n7A IV(\u0d85) \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.12.05 PART IV(A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.12.2019\n\n6. Store or sell oats.\n\n7. Making coconut shell charcoal or wood charcoal.\n\n8. Livestock production.\n\n9. Making soap.\n\n10. Buying or storing of new metals or old metals.\n\n11. Buying or storing of metal debris and scrap materials.\n\n12. Making or polishing furniture.\n\n13. Production of Cane Products\n\n14. Running a Carpentry Factory\n\n15. Soaking of coconut husks (stagnation)\n\n16. Manufacture of brushes (except toothbrushes)\n\n17. Automatic tearing of timber.\n\n18. Making Paint Paints, Varnishes or Distempers.\n\n19. Fiber Dyeing.\n\n20. Manufacture of Leather Goods.\n\n21. Making or repackaging chemicals.\n\n22. Making of Gas Mantle.\n\n23. Making the pot.\n\n24. Candle making.\n\n25. Making of mint.\n\n26. Making Writing Ink, Mold Ink, or Stencil Ink.\n\n27. Making laundry blue.\n\n28. Making of Bronze.\n\n29.