a Sabha.\n\n2. This by-law is known as the By-Law on the Maintenance of Retail Shops within Ayagama Pradeshiya Sabha Authoritative Area\n\n3. (1) No person shall maintain a shop for the sale of goods for human consumption unless there is a valid license"
